NULL,NULL,'[\"seven\", \"ten\", \"three\", \"eight\"]','seven','10 支給出去 3 支，剩下 7 支（seven）。',2,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(142,4,'reading','mcq','It is Sunday evening. Ben watches TV at eight. Then he goes to bed at nine.\n\nWhat day is it?',NULL,NULL,'[\"Sunday\", \"Monday\", \"Friday\", \"Wednesday\"]','Sunday','故事開頭說 It is Sunday evening（現在是星期日晚上）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(143,4,'reading','mcq','It is Sunday evening. Ben watches TV at eight. Then he goes to bed at nine.\n\nWhat time does Ben go to bed?',NULL,NULL,'[\"nine\", \"eight\", \"seven\", \"ten\"]','nine','故事說 he goes to bed at nine（他九點睡覺）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(144,4,'reading','mcq','There are seven days in a week. Saturday and Sunday are my favorite days.\n\nHow many days are in a week?',NULL,NULL,'[\"seven\", \"five\", \"six\", \"eight\"]','seven','故事說 There are seven days in a week（一星期有七天）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(145,5,'reading','mcq','Kate is tired and thirsty. She wants some water. After she drinks water, she feels happy.\n\nHow does Kate feel before she drinks water?',NULL,NULL,'[\"tired\", \"happy\", \"sick\", \"sorry\"]','tired','故事一開始說 Kate is tired and thirsty（凱特累了又渴）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(146,5,'reading','mcq','Kate is tired and thirsty. She wants some water. After she drinks water, she feels happy.\n\nHow does Kate feel after she drinks water?',NULL,NULL,'[\"happy\", \"sad\", \"angry\", \"hungry\"]','happy','故事說喝完水之後 she feels happy（她覺得開心）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(147,5,'reading','mcq','Leo\'s arm hurts. His hand is red. He is sad. His mom helps him.\n\nWhat hurts on Leo?',NULL,NULL,'[\"his arm\", \"his head\", \"his leg\", \"his foot\"]','his arm','故事說 Leo\'s arm hurts（里歐的手臂痛）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(148,5,'reading','mcq','Leo\'s arm hurts. His hand is red. He is sad. His mom helps him.\n\nHow does Leo feel?',NULL,NULL,'[\"sad\", \"happy\", \"angry\", \"tired\"]','sad','故事說 He is sad（他很難過）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(149,5,'reading','mcq','My eyes are big. My nose is small. My mouth is happy today!\n\nHow does \"my mouth\" feel today?',NULL,NULL,'[\"happy\", \"sad\", \"angry\", \"tired\"]','happy','故事說 My mouth is happy today（我的嘴巴今天很開心，意指笑容滿面）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(150,6,'reading','mcq','Tom wears a red shirt and black shoes today. He looks cool.\n\nWhat color is Tom\'s shirt?',NULL,NULL,'[\"red\", \"blue\", \"black\", \"green\"]','red','故事說 Tom wears a red shirt（湯姆穿紅色上衣）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(151,6,'reading','mcq','Tom wears a red shirt and black shoes today. He looks cool.\n\nWhat color are Tom\'s shoes?',NULL,NULL,'[\"black\", \"red\", \"white\", \"brown\"]','black','故事說 black shoes（黑色的鞋子）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(152,6,'reading','mcq','Emma has a purple dress and a pink hat. She likes pink best.\n\nWhat color does Emma like best?',NULL,NULL,'[\"pink\", \"purple\", \"blue\", \"yellow\"]','pink','故事說 She likes pink best（她最喜歡粉紅色）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(153,6,'reading','mcq','Emma has a purple dress and a pink hat. She likes pink best.\n\nWhat does Emma wear on her head?',NULL,NULL,'[\"a pink hat\", \"a purple hat\", \"a red hat\", \"a blue hat\"]','a pink hat','故事說 a pink hat（一頂粉紅色帽子）戴在頭上。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(154,6,'reading','mcq','My brother\'s jacket is orange. My jacket is green. We look different.\n\nWhat color is my jacket?',NULL,NULL,'[\"green\", \"orange\", \"yellow\", \"purple\"]','green','故事說 My jacket is green（我的外套是綠色的）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(155,7,'reading','mcq','Amy is in the library. She reads a book. She has a pencil and a notebook.\n\nWhere is Amy?',NULL,NULL,'[\"library\", \"classroom\", \"zoo\", \"park\"]','library','故事說 Amy is in the library（艾咪在圖書館）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(156,7,'reading','mcq','Amy is in the library. She reads a book. She has a pencil and a notebook.\n\nWhat does Amy have besides a pencil?',NULL,NULL,'[\"a notebook\", \"a ruler\", \"an eraser\", \"a computer\"]','a notebook','故事說 a pencil and a notebook（一支鉛筆和一本筆記本）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(157,7,'reading','mcq','Ben forgets his book bag at home. His teacher gives him a pencil box to use.\n\nWhat does Ben forget?',NULL,NULL,'[\"his book bag\", \"his pencil\", \"his ruler\", \"his eraser\"]','his book bag','故事說 Ben forgets his book bag（班忘記帶書包）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(158,7,'reading','mcq','There is a computer, a desk and a marker in the classroom.\n\nHow many things are in the classroom?',NULL,NULL,'[\"three\", \"two\", \"four\", \"one\"]','three','電腦、桌子、麥克筆，一共三樣東西。',2,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(159,7,'reading','mcq','There is a computer, a desk and a marker in the classroom.\n\nWhat is in the classroom besides a computer and a desk?',NULL,NULL,'[\"a marker\", \"a book\", \"a ruler\", \"an eraser\"]','a marker','故事說還有 a marker（一支麥克筆）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(160,8,'reading','mcq','It is July. The weather is hot and sunny. We go swimming.\n\nWhat month is it?',NULL,NULL,'[\"July\", \"January\", \"October\", \"December\"]','July','故事開頭說 It is July（現在是七月）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(161,8,'reading','mcq','It is July. The weather is hot and sunny. We go swimming.\n\nWhat is the weather like?',NULL,NULL,'[\"hot and sunny\", \"cold and windy\", \"cloudy and cool\", \"rainy and cold\"]','hot and sunny','故事說 The weather is hot and sunny（天氣又熱又晴朗）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(162,8,'reading','mcq','In winter, it is cold. In summer, it is hot. I like spring the best because it is warm.\n\nWhich season does \"I\" like best?',NULL,NULL,'[\"spring\", \"summer\", \"winter\", \"fall\"]','spring','故事說 I like spring the best（我最喜歡春天）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(163,8,'reading','mcq','In winter, it is cold. In summer, it is hot. I like spring the best because it is warm.\n\nWhat is the weather like in winter?',NULL,NULL,'[\"cold\", \"hot\", \"warm\", \"windy\"]','cold','故事說 In winter, it is cold（冬天很冷）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50'),(164,8,'reading','mcq','Today is cloudy and cool. Maybe it will be rainy tomorrow.\n\nWhat is the weather like today?',NULL,NULL,'[\"cloudy and cool\", \"hot and sunny\", \"cold and windy\", \"rainy and warm\"]','cloudy and cool','故事說 Today is cloudy and cool（今天多雲又涼爽）。',1,NULL,1,'2026-07-21 11:27:50','2026-07-21 11:27:50');
